---------------------------------------------------------------------------
This fork
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is an unofficial fork of Apache MetaModel, which was retired
by the Apache Software Foundation in June 2021 and moved to the Attic in
July 2021. It is not an ASF project and is not endorsed by the ASF.

It carries a security and modernisation audit of the code as it was at the
last upstream commit. 64 defects were found and fixed - among them an S1 SQL
injection in the JDBC layer, in which a FROM item alias was rendered
unquoted and unescaped in the WHERE, GROUP BY, HAVING and ORDER BY clauses -
and the build, which did not build at all when the audit started, was
restored and modernised.

The defects, with the evidence for each, are recorded in
docs/DEFECT-REGISTER.md. The changes are distributed under the same Apache
License, Version 2.0, and this file records the modification as section 4(b)
of that license requires.

